/* ============================================================================
 * GRAMMAR METADATA
 * ============================================================================ */

/*
 * Postal Code Grammar Collection
 * 
 * This index file provides access to 50+ country-specific postal code grammars
 * covering all major countries and territories worldwide.
 * 
 * Total Countries Covered: 50+
 * Total Grammars: 50+ (plus international comprehensive grammar)
 * 
 * Regions Covered:
 * - North America: 3 countries
 * - Europe: 15+ countries
 * - Asia: 12+ countries
 * - Oceania: 3+ countries
 * - Africa: 7+ countries
 * - South America: 8+ countries
 * 
 * Features:
 * - Country-specific validation rules
 * - Address parsing and formatting
 * - Postal code format validation
 * - Special postal code handling (military, diplomatic, etc.)
 * - Geographic region detection
 * 
 * Usage:
 * - Use <postal-code-grammar> for comprehensive international coverage
 * - Use <country-to-grammar> for country-specific validation
 * - Use individual grammar files for specific country processing
 */
